taskr 1.4.2: a small task tracker

Usage: taskr <command> [options]

  config   show the effective configuration
  due      tasks due soon, by day
  export   write tasks as JSON, CSV or Markdown
  help     show help
  list     list tasks
  search   find tasks by title
  show     show one task
  stats    counts and hours per group
  version  print the version

Run "taskr help <command>" for the options of one command.
